## P1 — High

### TYPOGRAPHY

- [ ] **Line-height inconsistency** — Body uses `leading-relaxed` (1.625) but some components use default line-height. Standardize: 1.5 body, 1.25 headings, 1.75 long-form.
- [ ] **Letter-spacing inconsistency** — `tracking-tight` is used on headings but not consistently. Define tracking scale: headings `-0.02em`, labels `0.05em`, uppercase `0.1em`.
- [ ] **Max-width inconsistency** — Content max-width varies: `max-w-[1280px]`, `max-w-[1100px]`, `max-w-[700px]`, `max-w-[680px]`, `max-w-6xl`. Standardize to a 7-column grid (1280px) or 5-column (1024px) system.
- [ ] **Missing responsive typography** — Some sections don't use `clamp()`. Ensure all headings use responsive clamp values.

### RTL LAYOUT & DIRECTIONALITY

- [ ] **RTL logical properties** — Replace physical `left`/`right` with `ms-`/`me-` (margin-start/end) and `ps-`/`pe-` (padding-start/end) where Tailwind supports it, or use CSS logical properties.
- [ ] **RTL icon mirroring** — `lucide-react` icons like `ArrowUp` in `BackToTopButton.tsx:73` don't auto-mirror in RTL. Consider using `dir-aware` icons or CSS `scaleX(-1)` for directional icons.
- [ ] **RTL grid gaps** — Ensure grid gaps and flex gaps render correctly in RTL. Tailwind `gap-*` is logical and should work, but test thoroughly.

### COLOR PALETTE & VISUAL HARMONY

- [ ] **Inconsistent surface colors** — `#0F172A`, `#111827`, `#12121a`, `#1a1a24` are all used as "card" or "surface" backgrounds. Consolidate to the CSS variable system (`--bg-surface`, `--bg-elevated`) and replace hardcoded values.
- [ ] **Inconsistent accent usage** — `#6366f1` (indigo) and `#3B82F6` (blue) are both used as primary accents. Choose one primary accent and use the other as secondary. Currently they're used interchangeably in buttons, borders, and text.
- [ ] **Light mode color mapping incomplete** — `globals.css` has many `!important` overrides for light mode. This is fragile. Migrate to CSS custom properties for all colors and use them directly in components.
- [ ] **Shadow system missing** — Shadows are hardcoded (`shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)]`). Define a shadow scale in Tailwind config (e.g., `shadow-sm`, `shadow-md`, `shadow-lg`, `shadow-glow`).
- [ ] **Border color inconsistency** — `rgba(148,163,184,0.06)`, `rgba(148,163,184,0.08)`, `rgba(148,163,184,0.1)`, `rgba(148,163,184,0.12)`, `rgba(148,163,184,0.14)`, `rgba(148,163,184,0.2)` are all used. Define a border scale (subtle, default, strong).

### ANIMATIONS & MOTION

- [ ] **Animation performance** — `ParticleCanvas.tsx` runs a full-screen canvas animation. Add `will-change: transform` and consider reducing particle count on mobile (currently 60, suggest 30 on mobile).
- [ ] **FadeIn animation duration** — `FadeIn.tsx:40` uses `duration-500`. Consider using `duration-700` for a more polished feel on larger screens.
- [ ] **Staggered animation gaps** — Some sections use `delay={i * 100}` (Services) and others `delay={i * 150}` (Pricing, Process). Standardize stagger delays.
- [ ] **Terminal typing speed** — `Terminal.tsx:30` uses 60ms typing / 30ms deleting. Consider slowing to 80ms/40ms for readability.
- [ ] **Hover animation consistency** — Some cards use `hover:-translate-y-1` while others use `hover:-translate-y-0.5`. Standardize to one value.
- [ ] **Missing page transition** — No route transition animations between pages. Add a subtle fade or slide transition using Framer Motion's `AnimatePresence`.

### USABILITY & NAVIGATION

- [ ] **Active nav state visibility** — `Navbar.tsx:113-117` changes background on scroll but doesn't clearly indicate which section is active. The `aria-current="location"` is set but visual indication is subtle (only text color change). Add an active indicator (underline or dot).
- [ ] **Keyboard navigation for cards** — Service cards (`Services.tsx:80`) are `<Link>` elements but not focusable via keyboard in a grid context. Ensure they're in the tab order.
- [ ] **Loading states** — No loading skeletons for async operations (assessment wizard, chat widget, portal login). Add skeleton loaders.
- [ ] **Error state consistency** — Error messages use `text-[#EF4444]` but some use `text-[#ef4444]`. Standardize error color and add error iconography.
- [ ] **Empty states** — No empty states for lists (testimonials, services, etc.). Add graceful empty state designs.
- [ ] **Image alt text** — No images in current components, but if images are added, ensure consistent alt text strategy.
- [ ] **Consistent CTA hierarchy** — Primary CTA uses `bg-[#6366f1]`, secondary uses border-only. Some CTAs use `bg-[#3B82F6]` (AIAgents.tsx:230, Phase3Labs.tsx:239). Standardize primary CTA to one color.
- [ ] **Card hover depth** — Some cards use `hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]` while others use subtle border changes. Standardize hover elevation.

