## P2 — Medium

### TYPOGRAPHY

- [ ] **Font loading strategy** — `globals.css:1` uses `@import url()` which render-blocks. Move to `<link rel="preload">` in `layout.tsx` or use `next/font` for optimal loading.
- [ ] **Monospace usage** — `JetBrains Mono` is used for stats and terminal. Ensure it's applied consistently for all data/code/numbers.
- [ ] **Arabic font fallback** — Add `font-family: 'Cairo', 'Noto Sans Arabic', sans-serif` for Arabic text with proper fallbacks.

### RTL LAYOUT & DIRECTIONALITY

- [ ] **RTL form layout** — `AssessmentWizard.tsx:136` grid uses `md:grid-cols-2`. In RTL, ensure form labels align right and inputs follow RTL reading order.
- [ ] **RTL quote direction** — `Testimonials.tsx:58` uses `"{review.text}"` with italic. In RTL, ensure quotes mirror correctly.

### COLOR PALETTE & VISUAL HARMONY

- [ ] **Dark mode default verification** — Ensure `prefers-color-scheme: dark` is the default and light mode is opt-in. Current implementation does this correctly via `layout.tsx:38-47`.
- [ ] **Color token documentation** — Document all color tokens, their usage rules, and contrast ratios in a design token file.
- [ ] **Gradient consistency** — Hero uses `radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% -20%, rgba(59,130,246,0.06), transparent)` while CTA uses `radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 50%, rgba(99,102,241,0.06), transparent)`. Standardize gradient tokens.

### ANIMATIONS & MOTION

- [ ] **Scroll-triggered animations** — Consider adding scroll-triggered parallax or reveal animations for section headers using Framer Motion `useInView`.
- [ ] **Micro-interactions** — Add subtle micro-interactions to buttons (ripple effect or scale on click) and form inputs (border animation on focus).
- [ ] **Animation accessibility** — Ensure all animations respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`. Current implementation in `FadeIn.tsx:14` and `Terminal.tsx:19` does this correctly, but audit all new components.

### USABILITY & NAVIGATION

- [ ] **Breadcrumbs** — Add breadcrumb navigation on nested pages (`/services/cloud-migration`, `/legal/privacy-policy`, etc.).
- [ ] **Page transition feedback** — Add a subtle loading indicator or skeleton when navigating between pages in the client-side router.
- [ ] **Error boundaries** — Add React error boundaries to prevent white-screen crashes on client components.
- [ ] **Consistent link styling** — Some links are underlined (`underline underline-offset-4`) while others are not. Establish a link style guide: nav links (no underline, hover underline), footer links (always underlined), body links (underline on hover).
- [ ] **Focus management** — When modals/chat open, trap focus. When they close, return focus to trigger element. Currently partially implemented in `Navbar.tsx` mobile menu.
- [ ] **Toast notifications** — Add a toast notification system for form submissions, API errors, and success states instead of inline messages only.
- [ ] **Scroll-to-top behavior** — `BackToTopButton.tsx` scrolls to top but doesn't account for the fixed navbar height. Offset scroll by 72px.

