## P3 — Low / Nice-to-Have

### TYPOGRAPHY

- [ ] **Variable font features** — Enable OpenType features (liga, kern, calt) for better typography.
- [ ] **Custom number formatting** — Use `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for stats and numbers to prevent layout shift.

### RTL LAYOUT & DIRECTIONALITY

- [ ] **RTL-specific illustrations** — If adding illustrations or icons with directional meaning, ensure they mirror in RTL.
- [ ] **RTL date/number formatting** — Ensure dates and numbers follow Arabic formatting conventions.

### COLOR PALETTE & VISUAL HARMONY

- [ ] **Dark/light mode transition** — Add a smooth CSS transition when switching themes (currently instant).
- [ ] **Dynamic theme based on system** — Already implemented, but consider adding a "follow system" option alongside manual toggle.

### ANIMATIONS & MOTION

- [ ] **Skeleton screen animations** — Add shimmer effect to skeleton loaders.
- [ ] **Page entrance animation** — Add a subtle fade-up animation on initial page load.
- [ ] **Reduced motion preferences** — Already implemented, but consider adding a user preference toggle for animation intensity.

### USABILITY & NAVIGATION

- [ ] **Keyboard shortcuts** — Add keyboard shortcuts for common actions (e.g., `/` to open chat, `Esc` to close modals).
- [ ] **Search functionality** — Add a search bar in the navbar for quick access to services and pages.
- [ ] **Onboarding tour** — Add a guided tour for first-time visitors highlighting key sections.
- [ ] **Cookie consent banner** — Add a cookie consent banner for GDPR compliance.
- [ ] **Language persistence** — Currently language switches via URL path (`/` vs `/ar`). Consider persisting language preference in localStorage.

