## Audit Notes

**Fonts:** Inter (Google Fonts) + JetBrains Mono. Inter is used for all UI text. JetBrains Mono is used for terminal, stats, and code blocks.

**RTL Pages:** `/app/ar/page.tsx` sets `dir="rtl"` on the `<main>` element. All components receive `locale="ar"` and conditionally render Arabic text. However, CSS directional properties (left/right, margin-left/right) are not automatically mirrored.

**Color System:**
- Dark mode: `#06060a` (bg-primary), `#0c0c12` (bg-secondary), `#12121a` (bg-surface), `#1a1a24` (bg-elevated)
- Light mode: `#fafafa` → `#e4e4e7` (CSS variables)
- Primary accent: `#6366f1` (indigo)
- Secondary accent: `#3B82F6` (blue) — used inconsistently with primary
- Success: `#10B981`, Warning: `#F59E0B`, Error: `#EF4444`

**Animations:**
- `ParticleCanvas`: 60 floating particles with connection lines (canvas)
- `FadeIn`: IntersectionObserver-based fade-up
- `Terminal`: Typewriter effect with blink cursor
- Hover: `-translate-y-0.5` to `-translate-y-1` on cards
- All respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

**Contrast Ratios (WCAG 2.1):**
