| `#e4e4e7` | `#06060a` | ~13.5:1 | AAA |
| `#a1a1aa` | `#06060a` | ~7.5:1 | AA |
| `#71717a` | `#06060a` | ~4.2:1 | Fail (small) |
| `#64748B` | `#06060a` | ~3.2:1 | Fail |
| `#94A3B8` | `#111827` | ~7.5:1 | AA |
| `#6366f1` | `#06060a` | ~5.5:1 | AA |
